{{define "subject"}}Refund blocked: ticket {{.Alert.TicketNumber}} was already used — {{.EventName}}{{end}}

{{define "html"}}<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>A refund was blocked</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f2f4f5;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f2f4f5;padding:24px 0;"><tr><td align="center">
<table role="presentation" width="560" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:560px;width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
  <tr><td align="center" style="background:#ffffff;padding:20px 32px 10px 32px;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;color:#22333D;">{{.Branding.OrgName}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="background:{{.Accent}};height:3px;font-size:1px;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:24px 32px 8px 32px;color:#46555f;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;">
  <h1 style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;color:#22333D;">A refund was blocked</h1>
  <p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">Someone tried to refund ticket <strong>#{{.Alert.TicketNumber}}</strong> of <strong>{{.EventName}}</strong>{{with .Alert.OrderNumber}} (order #{{.}}){{end}}, but the ticket was already scanned at the gate. Nothing was refunded and the ticket is unchanged.</p>
  {{with .Alert.Actor}}<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">Attempt made by: <strong>{{.}}</strong></p>{{end}}
  <p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">If this was you, no action is needed. If you do not recognise it, review who has access to your organization in Arena.</p>
  </td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:16px 32px 28px 32px;color:#93a0a8;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;border-top:1px solid #eceff1;">Arena Platform — automated message</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr></table>
</body>
</html>{{end}}

{{define "text"}}{{.Branding.OrgName}}

A refund was blocked

Someone tried to refund ticket #{{.Alert.TicketNumber}} of {{.EventName}}{{with .Alert.OrderNumber}} (order #{{.}}){{end}}, but the ticket was already scanned at the gate. Nothing was refunded and the ticket is unchanged.
{{with .Alert.Actor}}
Attempt made by: {{.}}
{{end}}
